  pocketRead: Routine nearby pockets usually pay out Iron Composite.
  nodeRead: Heavier node clusters here usually lead to Copper Ore.
  safePocketRead: Short relief spaces often still give Iron Composite, so retreat
    is not empty.
  routeRead: Route anchors hint this biome's material line before the player fully
    commits.
  rareRead: The expensive late pull of this family usually resolves into Structural
    Bracket.
